---
import FlightTrainingCenterLayout from "../../layouts/FlightTrainingCenterLayout.astro";
import ContactSection from "../../components/sections/ContactSection.astro";
import BreadcrumbSchema from "../../components/seo/BreadcrumbSchema.astro";
import ServiceSchema from "../../components/seo/ServiceSchema.astro";
import site from "../../data/site.json";

const breadcrumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', url: 'https://www.flyingsma.com/' },
  { name: 'Flight Training Center', url: 'https://www.flyingsma.com/flight-training-center/' },
  { name: 'Commercial Certificate', url: 'https://www.flyingsma.com/flight-training-center/commercial/' },
];
---

<FlightTrainingCenterLayout
	title="Commercial Certificate"
	description="Train for your commercial pilot certificate at Southern Maine Aviation, with instructors drawn from airline, corporate and military backgrounds."
>
	<BreadcrumbSchema slot="head" items={breadcrumbs} />
	<ServiceSchema
		slot="head"
		name="Commercial Pilot Training"
		description="Commercial pilot certificate training at Southern Maine Aviation, taught by instructors with airline, corporate and military experience."
		url="https://www.flyingsma.com/flight-training-center/commercial/"
		serviceType="Flight Training"
	/>
	<!-- Page Header -->
	<section class="relative text-white py-20 md:py-28 overflow-hidden">
		<div
			class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat"
			style="background-image: url('/images/fly/commercial-training.jpg');"
		></div>
		<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-950/95 via-slate-800/85 to-sky-800/75"></div>

		<div class="container mx-auto px-4 text-center relative z-10">
			<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold mb-6 drop-shadow-lg">Commercial Certificate</h1>
			<p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-sky-100 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8 drop-shadow">
				The certificate that lets you be paid to fly — and the gateway to a career in aviation.
			</p>
			<div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
				<a
					href={`tel:${site.contact.flight.phone}`}
					class="inline-flex items-center px-8 py-4 bg-white text-sky-900 font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-sky-50 transition-colors shadow-lg"
				>
					<i class="fa-solid fa-phone mr-2"></i>
					Call or Text: {site.contact.flight.phone}
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Main Content -->
	<section class="py-16 bg-white">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4">
			<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
				<p class="text-xl text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-8">
					If you are considering a career in aviation, the commercial certificate is the step that makes it
					possible. Training focuses on precision, judgement and the higher standard the FAA expects of a
					professional pilot — and you'll be learning it from instructors who have done the job.
				</p>

				<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 my-12">
					<div class="bg-sky-50 rounded-xl p-8">
						<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Learn From Working Pilots</h3>
						<p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
							Our instructors come from airline, corporate and military backgrounds. That matters most at the
							commercial stage, where the useful questions stop being about manoeuvres and start being about
							careers: what hiring looks like, how to build hours that count, and what the industry actually
							expects of a new professional pilot.
						</p>
						<p class="text-gray-700">
							It is the kind of guidance that is difficult to get from a syllabus.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="bg-green-50 rounded-xl p-8">
						<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Where It Leads</h3>
						<ul class="space-y-4 text-gray-700">
							<li class="flex items-start">
								<i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-green-600 mr-3 mt-1 flex-shrink-0"></i>
								<span>Flying for hire — charter, survey, banner, ferry and more</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start">
								<i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-green-600 mr-3 mt-1 flex-shrink-0"></i>
								<span>A stepping stone toward corporate and airline flying</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start">
								<i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-green-600 mr-3 mt-1 flex-shrink-0"></i>
								<span>Pairs naturally with a multi-engine rating</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start">
								<i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-green-600 mr-3 mt-1 flex-shrink-0"></i>
								<span>A higher standard of airmanship, whatever you fly next</span>
							</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Prerequisites -->
				<div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-8 my-12">
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Prerequisites</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">To begin commercial training you'll need:</p>
					<ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700">
						<li class="flex items-center">
							<i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right text-gray-500 mr-3"></i>
							Private Pilot Certificate
						</li>
						<li class="flex items-center">
							<i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right text-gray-500 mr-3"></i>
							Instrument rating strongly recommended
						</li>
						<li class="flex items-center">
							<i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right text-gray-500 mr-3"></i>
							Second-class medical certificate to exercise commercial privileges
						</li>
					</ul>
					<p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mt-4">
						Total time requirements depend on how you have built your hours so far. Call and we'll look at your
						logbook and lay out the most efficient route from where you are.
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- Related -->
				<div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-8 my-12">
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Often Taken Alongside</h3>
					<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
						<a href="/flight-training-center/instrument-rating" class="inline-flex items-center px-5 py-3 bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 font-medium rounded-lg hover:bg-sky-100 transition-colors">
							Instrument Rating
							<i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right text-xs ml-2"></i>
						</a>
						<a href="/flight-training-center/multi-engine" class="inline-flex items-center px-5 py-3 bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 font-medium rounded-lg hover:bg-sky-100 transition-colors">
							Multi-Engine Rating
							<i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right text-xs ml-2"></i>
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- CTA -->
				<div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-700 to-sky-700 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 text-white text-center my-12">
					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Thinking About Flying for a Living?</h2>
					<p class="text-sky-100 text-lg mb-6">
						Call for details. We're happy to talk honestly about what the path looks like from here.
					</p>
					<div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
						<a
							href={`tel:${site.contact.flight.phone}`}
							class="inline-flex items-center px-8 py-4 bg-white text-sky-700 font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-sky-50 transition-colors"
						>
							<i class="fa-solid fa-phone mr-2"></i>
							Call: {site.contact.flight.phone}
						</a>
						<a
							href={`mailto:${site.contact.flight.email}`}
							class="inline-flex items-center px-8 py-4 border-2 border-white text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors"
						>
							<i class="fa-solid fa-envelope mr-2"></i>
							Email Us
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="text-center">
					<a href="/flight-training-center" class="inline-flex items-center text-sky-600 hover:text-sky-800 font-medium">
						<i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-left mr-2"></i>
						Back to All Training Programs
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<ContactSection
		title="Questions About the Commercial Certificate?"
		description="Talk to an instructor who has flown professionally about what the path looks like from where you are."
		variant="default"
		showMap={false}
	/>
</FlightTrainingCenterLayout>
